     ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\"\<\\nMove your \!\(\*
StyleBox[\"Cursor\",
FontSize->16,
FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]]\) over the above sine and cosine \
curves.\\n\\n\>\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
